menu "HamletWorms"

config WORM_WIFI_SSID
    string "Wifi SSID"
    default ""
    help
        Leave empty to run entirely offline. The worm is complete without a
        network — this only lets it pick up newer generations as the server
        evolves them.

config WORM_WIFI_PASSWORD
    string "Wifi password"
    default ""

config WORM_SYNC_MINUTES
    int "Minutes between genome checks"
    default 60
    range 5 1440
    help
        A generation is a full pass of the play, about 6.9 hours, so there is
        nothing to gain from checking often.

endmenu
